cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "duckiebot-rl: from-scratch PPO for vision-based Duckiebot lane following with clean-room assets and MuJoCo sim-to-sim verification"
abstract: >-
  A from-scratch PyTorch implementation of Proximal Policy Optimization that learns
  vision-based lane following for a miniature differential-drive robot in a procedurally
  generated, aggressively randomized city built entirely from primitives and generated
  textures. The trained policy is transferred to an independent physics engine and renderer
  (MuJoCo) to measure how much behaviour survives a change of simulator, and is exported to
  ONNX for two Jetson deployment targets with an offline parity gate. No reinforcement-learning
  library and no third-party 3D asset is used. All results are produced on a single 8 GB laptop
  GPU under Windows.
